index 0000000..c69d952
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-retry-or-and-plain-callable-81ff1ab5a6d53987.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Fixed a regression since 8.4.2 where combining a retry strategy with a plain
+    callable using ``|`` or ``&`` raised an ``AttributeError`` instead of building
+    a ``retry_any`` or ``retry_all``. Both operand orders work again for sync and
+    async strategies, and the type annotations accept plain callables.
